      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.customer_message }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=PRODUCT NAME NORMALIZATION:\n\nThe product_name must ALWAYS be returned using the exact product name from the available products list.\n\nAvailable products:\n\n* Basic T-Shirt\n* Oversized Hoodie\n* Running Shoes\n* Classic Cap\n* Backpack\n\nThe user may use different words, abbreviations, singular/plural forms, or casual descriptions.\n\nYou must understand the user's meaning and map it to the closest available product.\n\nExamples:\n\n\"basic shirt\" → \"Basic T-Shirt\"\n\"basic shirts\" → \"Basic T-Shirt\"\n\"basic t-shirt\" → \"Basic T-Shirt\"\n\"basic t-shirts\" → \"Basic T-Shirt\"\n\"t-shirt\" → \"Basic T-Shirt\"\n\"t-shirts\" → \"Basic T-Shirt\"\n\"tee\" → \"Basic T-Shirt\"\n\"tees\" → \"Basic T-Shirt\"\n\n\"hoodie\" → \"Oversized Hoodie\"\n\"hoodies\" → \"Oversized Hoodie\"\n\"oversized hoodie\" → \"Oversized Hoodie\"\n\n\"running shoe\" → \"Running Shoes\"\n\"running shoes\" → \"Running Shoes\"\n\n\"cap\" → \"Classic Cap\"\n\"caps\" → \"Classic Cap\"\n\"classic cap\" → \"Classic Cap\"\n\n\"back pack\" → \"Backpack\"\n\"backpack\" → \"Backpack\"\n\"backpacks\" → \"Backpack\"\n\nNever return a synonym or the user's original wording when it clearly refers to an available product.\n\nFor example:\n\nUser: \"Can I get 2 basic shirts in black, medium?\"\n\nReturn:\n\n{\n\"intent\": \"order\",\n\"product_name\": \"Basic T-Shirt\",\n\"quantity\": 2,\n\"size\": \"M\",\n\"color\": \"black\"\n}\n\nDo not invent products that are not in the available products list.\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
